<title>UK: Gilt repos in M4 unchanged in Sept - BOE.</title>
<headline>Gilt repos in M4 unchanged in Sept - BOE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said gilt repos included in sterling lending to the M4 private sector supply were unchanged at 8.4 billion stg in September.</p>
<p>Reverse repos included in M4 rose by 1.6 billion stg to 15.0 billion, the Bank said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
